# What a CLI deploy must not upload.
#
# `.gitignore` already covers build output and secrets. This file removes the
# things that are committed but have no part in the build: 53MB of captured
# test runs, the brand source art, the planning docs, and the suites. Without
# it every `vercel deploy` ships them.
#
# Not a security control — the repo is private and Git-connected deployments
# clone the whole thing regardless. It is about upload size and build time.

test-run/
test/
assets/
yutic-brand/
# Only the top-level planning docs. `docs/legal/` must reach the build —
# `scripts/embed-legal.mjs` reads it to generate the published legal pages, and
# a gitignore-style `docs/` exclusion cannot be undone for a child directory.
docs/*.md
norma-bridge-usecase/
security/
.github/
.claude/

# Needed at runtime and deliberately NOT listed: migrations/ (the function
# bundles carry the .sql files — see FinishedSPEC §4f), src/, web/, scripts/.
